{"id":313,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深化党支部红色教育，传承“人民兵工第一校”的红色基因，9月7日，中北大学弹药工程与爆炸技术专业学生党支部在山东特种工业集团实习期间，组织开展了以“追寻红色足迹·传承兵工精神”为主题的红色教育活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sozQZfLzlYUNC4Ub49bUm9YnzV7LzUEZM7-YMzlboR7iLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2Mkh7UYybM8C4o7r2M8Ubo7L8nRnkMmNZLmCZL474LRnFnzMkUzr7oz6FLzCanRGJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7F4DC97F38EF7D98C4D4B69826831304/E3BA5D97/160D0\" vheight=\"308\" vwidth=\"513\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sn7MZVnNMRnzrVMbzTkMz-8L7r2LRnE7MmLDMNMkMzGsUm70gihFp2hmCIa0L1y8okyiokyDoz-8nmf7Lz7YUNL4Uz-aM7liUzVkLz6VM4TFnz9PMm-bnznFolVfMz9Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\"></p><p>山东特种工业集团起源于1938年，是华东地区诞生于抗日烽火中的第一个兵工厂，拥有深厚的红色军工底蕴。同学们走进企业展厅，凝视“把一切献给党”的红色标语，聆听企业从抗战时期修械所逐步发展为国内弹药领域龙头企业的发展历程。</p><p>在“自力更生发展军事工业”展板前，企业老师向同学们讲述了抗战时期山东人民兵工在极端困难条件下，自制弹药、步枪、手榴弹，用土办法支援前线的感人故事。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sUzNZsLNCsLmfVLb8CZLmC8UNWfLlUEiMRf7LmlYo7lanmU0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRokhfokybMlVko7CPM8WVoRvPMzU4LmTVLlUbnRNYU4nFM4-DM77YUNWFLzvZL77Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DC8A895AB8F17BE87154329E1D9D92C4/7264A2BB/1780A\" vheight=\"328\" vwidth=\"508\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sMmCZPUzGbMmCbnbRMVoRrkL4WRnzNE8U8-YM8WfMmUPLN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYy8okyZMSybozUZnmlZnmnkU4-inm94U4WVo7lDMz-4MRVFU8LiU47sM4AFUzLPM7LJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\"></p><p>在“孟良崮战役”与“沂蒙精神”展区，企业老师结合历史照片和统计数据，向同学们讲述了山东人民兵工为孟良崮战役供应弹药、支援前线的光辉历史，深刻诠释了“军民生死与共”的沂蒙精神。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sLzGZaoz9snz62nbRU4Mz6VMzn2LmGEZMzLPLlM2nmvbMm90gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZUShfUYy8M7-ZL8UYUmV2MzQkozvDUNCbM4LDL8CDUmrFLmlPnzCaM7QFLz-bozNJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/28AAC44B83D2B1F56B976BF97363F6B5/251E604F/12999\" vheight=\"284\" vwidth=\"503\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sM8CZ8M7lZMRvsnbzNZnmvDMNrVMRCEbU8M7L77ZLR6RMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVU1yDUYh2ozlZo77ZLzUYU46fnR6Roz9anzNDUz9anRTFnRGZoz-bMmMFo7W7Lz7Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\"></p><p>在“向模范工人赵占魁学习”展板前，企业老师详细介绍了赵占魁同志“用革命者态度对待工作的新式劳动者”精神，激励同学们在专业学习中精益求精、追求卓越。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snm-Z4M4CZolQfMb7rVM8U8MlrRUmGEPL4W7U46RMm-4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfokyPLSyZLmTVnNl8Ul7Yn7n7LmGYLzCbM4WfUNWVUlMFMm62nmNinRMFLzM7UzLJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4A811829EFE4AA2DDD20216972ABBEAC/67FF95D3/13DA3\" vheight=\"280\" vwidth=\"490\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sLRnZ7LzVRnlCPnb7UiM498nznVnmWE7ozvanR-sUmCYn7C0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPnky4MkyPLNlYLNrfLmG4nln2nNM2Uzn2L7LYMmnVUmAFMlQfoRUDU4QFoRC8UzlJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\"></p><p>一幅幅历史照片、一件件实物展品，生动再现了老一辈兵工人艰苦奋斗、自力更生的峥嵘岁月。在参观学习中，同学们深刻体会到“坚定正确的政治方向，艰苦奋斗的工作作风，求真务实的科学态度，坚韧不拔的进取意识”的太行精神内涵。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=so7CZsnNMVLR6kLbRLaMmVRL87PMmCEYM8QVnR67L8Lan7C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRM1h2nSh2LmlaLmLYM7-DM4rfM874L4ffol-ZMNCZo7MFUmWkM7U4UmMFLzlPnR9Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6C6FEF2502324B675A7A330A9B86F88C/B2B4D3B3/151D8\" vheight=\"284\" vwidth=\"504\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snzUZYMNUZoz-aMbRfknRAVMlCYUzUEanlUiL8WfMzNsLR90gihFp2hmCIa0nkhfLShkUSy8nlnVUNCiMRUYU4VRL7-YU8WfMmCPLlrRMR6FUNLaolUbUzQFo7LPoR7Jv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png\"></p><p>大家纷纷表示，作为中北大学弹药工程与爆炸技术专业的学生，要继承和发扬“人民兵工第一校”的光荣传统，将红色教育激发的热情转化为刻苦学习、投身国防的实际行动。此次红色教育活动，不仅增强了党支部的凝聚力和战斗力，也进一步坚定了同学们服务国防、服务地方的理想信念。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jdgc.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sozQZfLzlYUNC4Ub49bUm9YnzV7LzUEZM7-YMzlboR7iLlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYh2Mkh7UYybM8C4o7r2M8Ubo7L8nRnkMmNZLmCZL474LRnFnzMkUzr7oz6FLzCanRGJv2bjo4OeoDXNQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47aMmC0LzNDozUJqdenx&oid=1201705132&tid=1066&nid=19694&e=.png"}